ook:Slicing|Sliced]] black [[Cookbook:Olive|olives]]\n* Lebanese [[Cookbook:Cucumber|cucumber]], peeled and diced\n\n=== Dressing ===\n\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 1 squirt [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* Ground [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]] to taste\n* Sea [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]] to taste\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Mix all salad ingredients together.\n# In a separate bowl, mix dressing ingredients.\n# Stir dressing into salad.\n# Serve with flat bread and [[Cookbook:Feta Cheese|feta cheese]].\n\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber]]\n[[Category:Recipes using olive]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vinegar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Tomato and Onion Salad","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"6 tomatoes, chopped or diced","sourceText":"6 tomatoes, chopped or diced","amountText":"6 tomatoes, chopped or diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 red onion, diced","sourceText":"1 red onion, diced","amountText":"1 red onion, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 white onion, diced","sourceText":"1 white onion, diced","amountText":"1 white onion, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Spring onion, chopped finely","sourceText":"Spring onion, chopped finely","amountText":"Spring onion, chopped finely","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Sliced black olives","sourceText":"Sliced black olives","amountText":"Sliced black olives","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"Lebanese cucumber, peeled and diced","sourceText":"Lebanese cucumber, peeled and diced","amountText":"Lebanese cucumber, peeled and diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBindin